<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <style>
        .email-container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .otp-code {
            font-size: 32px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #4a90e2;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            background: #f5f5f5;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }
        .expiry-text {
            color: #666;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="email-container">
        <h2>Password Reset Request</h2>
        <p>Hello {{name}},</p>
        <p>We received a request to reset your password. Use the following OTP code to proceed:</p>
        
        <div class="otp-code">
            {{otp}}
        </div>
        
        <p class="expiry-text">This code will expire in 10 minutes ({{otpExpiry}}).</p>
        
        <p>If you didn't request this password reset, please ignore this email or contact support if you have concerns.</p>
        
        <p>Best regards,<br>Finzefy Team</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>